---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="footer">
  <p>魔力全书 &copy; {currentYear} make with ❤️</p>
  <p>本站所有图档等资料版权 - 史克威尔艾尼克斯</p>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    margin-left: var(--sidebar-width);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 719px) {
    .footer {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
